n's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather. The leather is 1.2 mm thick.\nThick yet soft cowhide leather.\nThe base color of the leather is black.\nThe vest was braided around the edges with black cords.\n3 chrome-plated buckles (carabiners) as closures\nThree adjustable straps (buckles) per side\nEach strap has 5 holes for adjustment.\nThis way the vest also fits over the jacket.\nFive outer pockets (3 with zippers, 2 chest pockets with snap fasteners)\nTwo inside pockets, one of which has a zipper.\nThe lining is made of cotton.\nPlease refer to the size chart.\nSince this is a fitted women's vest (SLIM)","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9078-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9078-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9078-3.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9215","slug":"women-s-lamb-nappa-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9215","name":"Women's Lamb Nappa Leather Vest","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Genuine lamb nappa leather\r\nBlack base color\r\nSoft leather\r\nLeather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\n2 outer pockets\r\n2 inside pockets\r\nLeather drawstring at the waist for adjustment\r\nBraided leather band as a border\r\n3 buckle carabiners as closure\r\nAthletic fit (slim fit)","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9215-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraf