/Red","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThe base color of the leather is black.\r\nThe upper part was quilted with a checkered pattern.\r\nA polyester filling has been sewn under the quilted pattern to make the pattern more visible.\r\nThe lower part is made of perforated cowhide leather.\r\nAll decorative seams are in red.\r\n2 outer pockets with concealed snap closure\r\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\r\nThe inner pockets are sewn slightly lower.\r\nSo that the patches fit on the front.\r\nExpandable at the sides via zippers\r\nExtendable by 5 cm on each side\r\nThe back end is rounded off by 5 cm.\r\nSo that the vest doesn't stick out while driving","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-4.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9200-5.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9201","slug":"men-s-black-camo-vest-with-perforated-leather-pcp-lv-9201","name":"Men's black camo vest with perforated leather","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThe base color of the leather is black.\r\nThe upper part is dyed in a camo pattern.\r\nThe lower part is made of perforated cowhide leather.\r\n2 outer pockets with hidden snap closure\r\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\r\nThe inner pockets are sewn slightly lower.\r\nSo that the patches fit on the front.\r\nExpandable at the sides via zippers\r\nExtendable by 5 cm on each side\r\nThe back end is rounded off by 5 cm.\r\nSo that the vest doesn't stick out while driving","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-4.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9201-5.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LG-PROTECTOR-YELLOW","slug":"protectors-set-2-0-pcp-lg-protector-yellow","name":"Protectors set 2.0","category":"Protector","categorySlug":"protector","description":"The European standard (EN) 1621-1 regulates the minimum size for the areas to be protected at the joints and sets requirements for the protector's ability to absorb impacts and thus protect the wearer from injury.\r\n2x shoulder protectors\r\n2x elbow protectors\r\n1x back protector\r\nCE-approved protectors\r\nIdeal for motorcycle jackets","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LG-PRY-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LG-PRY-2.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1046","slug":"men-s-motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1046","name":"Men's Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"Genuine cowhide nappa leather\r\nThe base color of the leather is black.\r\nThe surface was treated with a vintage look.\r\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThick yet soft leather\r\nRocker Billy Kragen\r\nQuilted shoulders and sleeves\r\nAdjustable sides via leather straps with buckles\r\nThe waist is also adjustable with a belt.\r\nThe belt is removable.\r\n3 zippered outer pockets\r\n1 outer pocket with snap fastener\r\n2 inside pockets, one with a zipper\r\nA pocket with a snap fastener is located on the left shoulder.\r\nThere is a zippered pocket on the right shoulder.\r\nRemovable inner lining\r\nZipper as a type of closure\r\nA piece of leather was incorporated under the main zipper (to make the jacket windproof).\r\nThe main zipper can be closed all the way to the top.\r\nZippers on both cuffs\r\nAll zippers are from the company YKK.\r\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\r\nAll protectors are removable.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1046-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1046-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1046-3.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LG-H05","slug":"motorcycle-leather-glove-in-black-pcp-lg-h05","name":"Motorcycle leather glove in black","category":"Gloves","categorySlug":"gloves","description":"$4","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LG-H05-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LG-H05-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LG-H05-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LG-H05-4.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LG-H05-5.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LP-812","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-jeans-leather-trousers-side-laced-pcp-lp-812","name":"Men's Biker Leather Jeans Leather Trousers Side Laced","category":"Leather Pants","categorySlug":"leather-pants","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nLeather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nBlack base color\r\nThick yet soft nappa leather\r\nLaced at the sides\r\n5 Pocket Jeans\r\n5 pockets, 2 in the front, 2 in the back, 1 small pocket in the front which is located inside the larger pocket in the front.\r\nThe trousers can be closed at the top with a button and a zipper.\r\nThese leather trousers have a standard length of at least L34, meaning you can simply cut them to your desired length and attach the hem with strong glue (or of course, you can sew them).\r\nPolyester lining that reaches down to the knee.\r\nSeamless knees\r\nAmerican inch size\r\n\r\nConverting the inch size of your pants to centimeters is easy. Multiply the width (W) by 2.5, and you'll have the waist circumference.\r\n\r\nExample:\r\nW34 × 2.5 = 85 cm waist circumference.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["29","30","31","32","33","34","36","38","40","42","44","47"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LP-812-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LP-812-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LP-812-3.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LV-900","slug":"motorcycle-biker-leather-vest-with-carabiner-pcp-lv-900","name":"Motorcycle Biker Leather Vest with Carabiner","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\r\nThe vest is black and has been finished with black leather cord.\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\r\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be maintained with everyday care products such as leather milk, leather cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\r\nThe vest can be expanded by up to 5cm on both sides, so you can also wear the vest over a jacket.\r\nThey have 3 chrome-plated buckles as a closure.\r\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-900-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-900-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-900-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-900-4.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9056","slug":"fitted-women-s-leather-vest-with-zipper-pcp-lv-9056","name":"Fitted women's leather vest with zipper","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust and soft lambskin leather\r\nThe vest is black\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\r\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be maintained with everyday care products such as leather milk, leather cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\r\nThe vest can be expanded by up to 5cm on both sides, so you can also wear the vest over a jacket.\r\nThey have a zipper as a closure.\r\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\r\nTailored women's cut (so that the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9056-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9056-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9056-3.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-9144","slug":"lightweight-women-s-leather-vest-with-snap-fasteners-pcp-lj-9144","name":"Lightweight women's leather vest with snap fasteners","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust and soft lambskin leather\r\nThe vest is black\r\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\r\nVery easy to care for; use leather care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc.\r\nThe leather remains supple and permanently soft.\r\nThe vest can be expanded by up to 5cm on both sides, so you can wear the vest over a jacket.\r\nThey have 4 buttons as a closure.\r\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one with a zipper\r\nTailored women's cut (so that the vest doesn't stick out)\r\nThe lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9144-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9144-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9144-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-9144-4.jpg"],"featured":true},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1018","slug":"men-s-leather-jacket-in-brown-pcp-lj-1018","name":"Men's leather jacket in brown","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"Trendy biker-style casual jacket\r\nsmall collar and biker-style quilted elements\r\nFigure-hugging, slim fit style with a straight cut\r\nPlease refer to the size chart included in the images.\r\nThere are buckles on the sides to adjust the jacket.\r\nJacket made of high-quality and soft lambskin leather\r\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\r\nThe leather was treated to give it a used look, for a unique appearance.\r\nTwo deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper.\r\nFour outer pockets, all four are equipped with zippers.\r\nquilted shoulders and sleeves\r\nThe cuffs also have zippers.","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1018-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1018-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1018-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1018-4.jpg"],"featured":true},{