sic colour of the leather is black\r\n\r\nQuilted shoulders\r\n\r\n2 outer pockets with zip\r\n\r\n2 inside pockets one with zip\r\n\r\nZip fastening type\r\n\r\nOn the sides you have 3 velcro fasteners for adjustment","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9220-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9221","slug":"nubuck-biker-ladies-leather-waistcoat-in-matt-pcp-lv-9221","name":"Nubuck biker ladies leather waistcoat in matt","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"The waistcoat is made from genuine nubuck buffalo leather\r\nSoft leather\r\nPerforated leather (wind permeable)\r\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\r\nQuilted shoulders\r\n2 outer pockets with zip\r\n2 inside pockets one with zip\r\nZip fastening type\r\nOn the sides you have 3 velcro fasteners for adjustment","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9221-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9222","slug":"ladies-biker-custom-leather-waistcoat-with-fasteners-pcp-lv-9222","name":"Ladies biker custom leather waistcoat with fasteners","category":"Women's Vest","categorySlug":"women-s-vest","description":"The waistcoat is made from genuine cowhide leather\r\n\r\nSoft leather\r\n\r\nPerforated leather (wind permeable)\r\n\r\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\r\n\r\nQuilted shoulders\r\n\r\n2 outer pockets with zip\r\n\r\n2 inside pockets one with zip\r\n\r\nZip fastening type\r\n\r\nOn the sides you have 3 velcro fasteners for adjustment","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9222-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-100","slug":"retro-motorcycle-leather-jacket-black-pcp-lj-100","name":"Retro Motorcycle Leather Jacket – Black","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The style of the past combined with the technology of today offers an ultra-stylish look, beautifully accentuated by the straight, body-hugging cut and the quilted shoulders with typical arm loops.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.\n\nJacket made of genuine, robust cowhide leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nQuilted shoulders.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable.\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super-strong materials.\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides so it doesn't flap while riding.\n\nFour front pockets with zippers.\n\nOff-center front zipper.\n\nAll external zippers are YKK robust metal zippers.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back.\n\nAll protectors are removable.\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-100-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1003","slug":"men-s-retro-motorbike-jacket-in-cowhide-nappa-leather-pcp-lj-1003","name":"Men's Retro Motorbike Jacket in Cowhide Nappa Leather","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made from genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide leather\n\nVery good quality and workmanship\n\nComfortable to wear\n\nTimeless model offers an ultra-sleek look\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way\n\nBasic colour:- Black\n\nMaterial:- 100% cowhide nappa leather\n\nLeather stability:- 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nWith protectors on shoulder, elbow and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nFront zip\n\nFour front pockets with zip\n\nRemovable thermal lining\n\nZip at the cuffs\n\nThe jacket is quilted on the shoulders\n\nAll outer zips are YKK robust metal zips\n\nInner lining: Polyester (removable)\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1003-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1014","slug":"motorbike-chopper-leather-jacket-with-eagle-embossing-pcp-lj-1014","name":"Motorbike Chopper Leather Jacket with Eagle Embossing","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"$e","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1014-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1026","slug":"buffalo-nubuck-motorbike-leather-jacket-in-matt-black-pcp-lj-1026","name":"Buffalo Nubuck Motorbike Leather Jacket in Matt Black","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made from genuine, robust nubuck buffalo leather, with a leather thickness of approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and / or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super strong materials and prepared protector pockets with protectors on the back, elbows and shoulders\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides with a buckle so that it does not flap when riding\n\n2 pockets with zips on the chest\n\nat the same time there are also air vents\n\nAlso 2 front pockets with zips\n\nOff-centre front zip with a piece of leather sewn under the zip to keep the jacket windproof\n\nAll outer zips are YKK robust metal zips\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\n\n\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)\"","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1026-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1024","slug":"vintage-motorbike-leather-jacket-with-protectors-pcp-lj-1024","name":"Vintage Motorbike Leather Jacket with Protectors","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Vintage biker motorbike leather jacket\n\nThe leather has a used look\n\nGenuine cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe colour of the leather is dark brown with light applications\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nLeather strips have been processed on both sleeves\n\nFour outside pockets (all with zip)\n\nTwo inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nThe jacket can be closed with a zip\n\nA wind stopper has been sewn under the fastening\n\nThe collar can be closed with a press stud\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester (removable)\n\nConnecting piece for motorbike trousers\n\nThe jacket can be adjusted at the sides using Velcro fasteners\n\nZips on the sides allow you to make the jacket larger\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nAll zips are robust and stable from the company YKK\n\nPlease pay attention to the size chart when buying\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1024-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-160","slug":"men-s-motorcycle-leather-jacket-made-of-soft-cowhide-black-brown-nubuck-pcp-lj-160","name":"Men's Motorcycle Leather Jacket Made of Soft Cowhide – Black, Brown Nubuck","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made of genuine, robust cowhide nappa leather with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nTwo deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super-strong materials and prepared protector pockets with protectors on the back, elbows, and shoulders\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nThe jacket can be tightened at the sides with a buckle so it doesn't flap while riding\n\nTwo zippered pockets on the chest\n\nalso have air vents\n\nIn addition to two front pockets with zippers\n\nAn off-center zipper below the zipper is a leather piece that makes the jacket windproof\n\nAll external zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nZipper closures on the sleeves, snap fasteners on the cuffs Cuffs\n\nStand-up collar with snap fastener\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black / Brown"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-160-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-160-2.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1041","slug":"fringed-motorbike-chopper-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1041","name":"Fringed Motorbike Chopper Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is brown\n\nThe surface of the leather has a vintage look\n\nThe jacket has fringes on the back, chest and arm area\n\nAll fringes are firmly sewn into the jacket\n\nTypical rockabilly collar\n\nThe collar can be worn open or closed\n\nRemovable belt\n\nTwo outer pockets with zip\n\nTwo inside pockets, one with zip\n\n5 protector pockets\n\nElbow, back and shoulders\n\nThe protectors are included in the scope of delivery\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1041-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-104","slug":"men-s-fringe-leather-jacket-native-american-style-pcp-lj-104","name":"Men's Fringe Leather Jacket, Native American Style","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The base color is black/brown\n\nThe material is 100% cowhide\n\nThe leather strength is 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nUpper part made of cowhide nubuck leather, lower part made of cowhide nappa leather\n\nRibboned darts at the front and shoulders\n\nFront zipper closure\n\nTwo front pockets with zipper closure\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zipper closure\n\nZipper closure at the cuffs\n\nFringe trim at the front and back\n\nLeather side drawstrings on both sides\n\nInner lining: polyester\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-104-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1037","slug":"retro-motorbike-leather-jacket-in-vintage-style-pcp-lj-1037","name":"Retro Motorbike Leather Jacket in Vintage Style","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide leather with a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nUnique retro-used look\n\nThe leather was processed in a vinatge look\n\nQuilted areas on the shoulders, upper arms, back and elbows\n\nAdjustable straps at the waist (to prevent the jacket from flapping when riding)\n\nRobust zip (diagonal)\n\nZip on the cuffs\n\nFour outer pockets with zips\n\nTwo inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nThe thermal inner lining is removable\n\nThe inside pockets are not in the jacket on the lining\n\nThere is a zip for the trousers in the jacket (with a counterpart)\n\nA kidney belt has been incorporated into the back of the jacket\n\nThere are also 2 air vents on the back\n\nThe jacket can be used as a leisure or motorbike jacket\n\nThe jacket is slim fit (tailored men's cut)\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1037-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-117","slug":"retro-motorcycle-leather-jacket-black-black-white-black-green-black-red-pcp-lj-117","name":"Retro Motorcycle Leather Jacket – Black, Black/White, Black/Green, Black/Red","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made of genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide nappa leather\n\nSporty fit, comfortable to wear\n\nThe style of yesteryear combined with modern technology offers an ultra-stylish look thanks to the straight, body-hugging cut and the quilted shoulders with typical armholes.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.\n\nMaterial: 100% Cow Nappa Leather\n\nInner: Polyester / Mesh\n\nLeather Durability: -1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-center front zipper\n\nFour front pockets with zippers\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zipper\n\nZipper closures on the cuffs\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super-strong materials and prepared protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nProtectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Green / Red / White / Black"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-117-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-117-2.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-117-3.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-117-4.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1042","slug":"brown-motorbike-leather-jacket-in-soft-cowhide-pcp-lj-1042","name":"Brown Motorbike Leather Jacket in Soft Cowhide","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is brown\n\nThe leather thickness is 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather has a slightly used look\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThe inner lining is fastened with a zip and can therefore be removed\n\nConnection zip for the trousers (with counterpart)\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zip)\n\n4 outer pockets with zips)\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1042-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-102","slug":"retro-biker-motorcycle-leather-jacket-black-red-pcp-lj-102","name":"Retro Biker Motorcycle Leather Jacket – Black/Red","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The style of the past combined with the technology of today offers an ultra-stylish look thanks to the straight, fitted cut and the quilted shoulders with typical armholes.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.Base Color: Black / Red\n\nMaterial: 100% COWHIDE\n\nLeather Durability: 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-center front zipper\n\nFour front zippered pockets\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nZipper closures at the cuffs\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK metal zippers\n\nInner Lining: Polyester, removable black quilted lining\n\nJacket is made of genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide\n\nComfortable, sporty fit\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-102-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1023","slug":"nubuck-brown-motorbike-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1023","name":"Nubuck Brown Motorbike Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The leather has a used look\n\nGenuine cowhide (nubuck leather) with a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is brown\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nLeather strips have been processed on both sleeves\n\nFour outer pockets (all with zips)\n\nTwo inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nThe jacket can be closed with a zip\n\nA wind stopper has been sewn under the fastening\n\nThe collar can be closed with a press stud\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester (removable)\n\nConnecting piece for motorbike trousers\n\nThe jacket can be adjusted at the sides using Velcro fasteners\n\nZips on the sides allow you to make the jacket larger\n\nAll zips are robust and stable from the company YKK\n\n\n\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1023-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-107","slug":"rocker-billy-motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-107","name":"Rocker Billy Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made of genuine, robust cowhide\n\nComfortable to wear\n\nBase Color: Black\n\nMaterial: 100% COWHIDE\n\nLeather Durability: 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-center front zipper\n\nFront half-belt with buckle closure\n\nThree front pockets with zippers\n\nOne front pocket with snap closure\n\nZippered cuffs\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zipper\n\nButtoned epaulettes\n\nLining: Polyester\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-107-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1025","slug":"retro-motorbike-leather-jacket-with-protectors-pcp-lj-1025","name":"Retro Motorbike Leather Jacket with Protectors","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The style of the old days and the technology of today offers an ultra-smart look with a straight, body-hugging cut and the quilted shoulders with typical arm rings are beautifully accentuated.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way\n\nJacket made from genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe jacket is black and has been finished with red or green extras\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super strong materials and prepared protectors Pockets with protectors on the back, elbows and shoulders\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nThe jacket can be pulled tighter on both sides so that it does not flap when riding\n\nFour front pockets with zip\n\nOff-centre front zip\n\nAll outer zips are YKK robust metal zips\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1025-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1049","slug":"grey-motorbike-chopper-leather-jacket-with-protectors-pcp-lj-1049","name":"Grey Motorbike Chopper Leather Jacket with Protectors","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is grey or black\n\nThe surface has a vintage look\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nRocker billy collar\n\nQuilted shoulders and sleeves\n\nAdjustable sides with leather straps with buckles\n\nWaist is also adjustable with a belt\n\nThe belt is removable\n\n3 outer pockets with zip\n\n1 outer pocket with press stud\n\n2 inside pockets, one with zip\n\nOne pocket with press stud on the left shoulder\n\nOne zip pocket on the right shoulder\n\nRemovable inner lining\n\nZip fastening\n\nA piece of leather has been used under the main zip (so that the jacket is windproof)\n\nThe main zip can be closed all the way to the top\n\nZips on both cuffs\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nProtectors on shoulders, elbows and back\"","material":"Genui