ectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1030-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1004","slug":"studded-biker-leather-jacket-red-pcp-lj-1004","name":"Studded Biker Leather Jacket – Red","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"$f","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1004-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-101","slug":"men-s-retro-motorcycle-leather-jacket-black-white-yellow-pcp-lj-101","name":"Men's Retro Motorcycle Leather Jacket – Black/White, Yellow","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"This jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.\n\nJacket made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe jacket is black and has been finished with yellow accents\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides so it doesn't flap while riding\n\nFour front pockets with zippers\n\nOff-center front zipper\n\nAll external zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Yellow / White"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-101-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-101-2.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1033","slug":"men-s-motorbike-biker-leather-jacket-retro-style-black-red-pcp-lj-1033","name":"Men's Motorbike Biker Leather Jacket Retro Style – Black/Red","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nThe jacket has red appliqués on the shoulders and sleeves\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nZips have been incorporated into the cuffs\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester (air permeable)\n\nAbove this is a thermal inner lining with a cotton lining\n\nIn the inner lining there is a connecting zip for the trousers (with counterpart)\n\nThe inner lining can be removed using a zip fastener\n\nIdeal for the summer\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which can be closed with a zip\n\nCan be closed with a large zip\n\nAll zips are from the original YKK company\n\nThere is a wind stopper under the main zip (also made of leather)\n\nThere are buckles on the sides to adjust the jacket\n\nProtectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1033-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-119","slug":"nubuck-leather-motorcycle-jacket-pcp-lj-119","name":"Nubuck Leather Motorcycle Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made of genuine, robust, high-quality, soft buffalo nubuck leather\n\nSporty fit, comfortable to wear\n\nThe style of the past combined with the technology of today offers an ultra-stylish look thanks to the straight, body-hugging cut and the quilted shoulders with typical armholes.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.\n\nMaterial: 100% Buffalo Nubuck Leather\n\nLonger cut\n\nInner: Polyester / Mesh\n\nLeather strength: 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-center front zipper\n\nFour front pockets with zippers\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zipper\n\nZipper closures on the cuffs\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super-strong materials and prepared protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nProtectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-119-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-121","slug":"longer-chopper-motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-121","name":"Longer Chopper Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Reverse collar with snap fastener\n\nSlightly tailored fit\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way\n\n100% COWHIDE LEATHER with a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-centered high-closing front zipper\n\nFour front zippered pockets\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one of which is zippered\n\nZippered cuffs\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK heavy-duty metal zippers\n\nAdjustable belt at waist level\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester, with a removable quilted lining\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nProtectors on shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nProtectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-121-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1034","slug":"retro-biker-motorbike-leather-jacket-black-white-pcp-lj-1034","name":"Retro Biker Motorbike Leather Jacket – Black/White","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nThe jacket has white applications on the shoulders and sleeves\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nZips have been incorporated into the cuffs\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester (air permeable)\n\nAbove this is a thermal inner lining with a cotton lining\n\nIn the inner lining there is a connecting zip for the trousers (with counterpart)\n\nThe inner lining can be removed using a zip fastener\n\nIdeal for the summer\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which can be closed with a zip\n\nCan be closed with a large zip\n\nAll zips are from the original YKK company\n\nThere is a wind stopper under the main zip (also made of leather)\n\nThere are buckles on the sides to adjust the jacket\n\nProtectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1034-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-122","slug":"longer-motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-122","name":"Longer Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide nappa leather (1.1–1.2 mm thick)\n\nBlack leather – timeless and robust\n\nThick yet soft leather for maximum comfort\n\nRemovable protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nLong cut for additional protection\n\nTwo main zippers for summer and winter use\n\nRemovable polyester lining\n\nElasticated belt at the back for a perfect fit\n\nLapel collar for a classic motorcycle jacket look\n\nPerfect for all seasons\n\nIdeal for long rides and everyday wear\n\nCombination of safety, comfort, and timeless design\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-122-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-135","slug":"men-s-used-look-motorcycle-leather-jacket-with-collar-pcp-lj-135","name":"Men's Used-Look Motorcycle Leather Jacket with Collar","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather.\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown.\n\nThe surface has been dyed black.\n\nThis creates a unique used-look.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nRemovable thermal lining.\n\n4 outer pockets (all with zippers).\n\n2 inner pockets (one with a zipper).\n\nAll closures are made by YKK.\n\nProtectors on the back, elbows, and shoulders.\n\nProtectors are removable.\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-135-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-780","slug":"motorbike-chopper-fringed-jacket-pcp-lj-780","name":"Motorbike Chopper Fringed Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The smooth leather is made of genuine cowhide\n\nThe rough leather is made of buffalo nubuck leather\n\nLeather stability is 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nReverse biker collar\n\nOff-centre front zip\n\nFront half belt with buckle fastening\n\nTwo front pockets with zip\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zip fastening\n\nEpaulettes with buttons\n\nZip fastening on the cuffs\n\nFringed trim on the lower sleeves and back\n\nTwo conchos at the front\n\nTwo conchos at the back\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-780-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-162","slug":"men-s-genuine-leather-motorcycle-jacket-pcp-lj-162","name":"Men's Genuine Leather Motorcycle Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Blends vintage style with modern technology, offering an ultra-stylish look with a straight, tailored cut and quilted shoulders, beautifully accentuated by signature armholes.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.\n\nJacket made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe jacket is black.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable.\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides with a Velcro fastener so it doesn't flap while riding.\n\nTwo arm pockets.\n\nOff-centered front zipper.\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK robust metal zippers.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be maintained with everyday care products such as care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nTwo front zippered pockets.\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back.\n\nAll protectors are removable.\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-162-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-171","slug":"men-s-motorbike-leather-jacket-grey-pcp-lj-171","name":"Men's Motorbike Leather Jacket – Grey","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made from genuine, robust cowhide leather, with a leather thickness of approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is vintage grey\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and / or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one of which has a zip\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides with a Velcro fastener so that it does not flap when riding\n\nTwo front pockets with zip\n\nA piece of leather has been sewn under the front zip to keep the jacket windproof\n\nAll outside zips are YKK robust metal zips\n\nZips on the sleeves so that the gloves also fit under the jacket\n\nStand-up collar with a buckle so that the collar does not flap around when riding\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-171-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-159","slug":"studded-biker-leather-jacket-for-men-pcp-lj-159","name":"Studded Biker Leather Jacket for Men","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"$10","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-159-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1043","slug":"classic-motorbike-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1043","name":"Classic Motorbike Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nZip fastening type\n\nA piece of leather has been sewn under the main zip (so that the jacket is windproof)\n\n2 inside pockets one with zip\n\n2 outer pockets with zips\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nThere are 2 air vents at the front for the summer.\n\nAt the back you have zips so that the wind draws out again and the jacket does not flutter.\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1043-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1015","slug":"classic-motorbike-rockerbilly-jacket-pcp-lj-1015","name":"Classic Motorbike Rockerbilly Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Made from the finest, hard-wearing cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nSturdy zip fastener for closing (original YKK zip)\n\nYou can adjust the jacket at the sides\n\nThe jacket has 5 protector pockets\n\nThe protectors are included in the scope of delivery\n\nYou have 3 outside pockets with zip\n\n2 inside pockets one of them with a zip\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1015-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1036","slug":"motorbike-men-s-leather-jacket-grey-pcp-lj-1036","name":"Motorbike Men's Leather Jacket – Grey","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nso you can use any trousers as combination trousers\n\nThere is a zip inside the jacket that you can use to connect your trousers\n\nThe counterpart is also included\n\nAt the front you have 2 air passages that you can close with a zip\n\nThere are also zips on the back for ventilation\n\n4 outer pockets can all be closed with a zip\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nAll zips are from YKK\n\nThe jacket is adjustable at the sides thanks to Velcro fasteners\n\nIn addition, the jacket has integrated elasticated bands at the sides to make the jacket elasticated at the waist\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1036-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-778","slug":"motorbike-chopper-fringed-jacket-pcp-lj-778","name":"Motorbike Chopper Fringed Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made from genuine, robust cowhide leather\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nBasic colour: Black\n\nMaterial:- 100% COW LEATHER\n\nLeather stability:- 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nReverse collar\n\nOff-centre front zip\n\nFront half belt with buckle fastening\n\nTwo front pockets with zip\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zip fastening\n\nZip fastening on the cuffs\n\nFringed trim on the lower sleeves, front and back\n\nTwo conchos at the front\n\nTwo conchos at the back\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-778-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1035","slug":"men-s-studded-biker-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1035","name":"Men's Studded Biker Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made of genuine leather (cowhide nappa leather)\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThree outside pockets with zips\n\nTwo inside pockets one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nAll rivets are riveted through the leather (very sturdy and strong)\n\nAll rivets are nickel free\n\nElasticated sides (so that the jacket has a tailored fit)\n\nProtectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1035-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1060","slug":"retro-motorbike-leather-jacket-red-pcp-lj-1060","name":"Retro Motorbike Leather Jacket – Red","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made from genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is red\n\nThe surface has been given a used look\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets\n\nAll pockets are equipped with a zip\n\nThe thermal inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nA connecting zip has been sewn into the jacket\n\nSo you can use any trousers as a connection\n\nThe counterpart for sewing in is included in the scope of delivery\n\n5 protector pockets on the shoulders, elbow and back\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nThere is a Velcro fastener on the sides to adjust the waist\n\nThere is a zip under the Velcro fastener for expansion\n\nEach side can be extended by up to 5 cm\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nPlease pay attention to the size chart\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1060-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1061","slug":"motorbike-leather-jacket-green-pcp-lj-1061","name":"Motorbike Leather Jacket – Green","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made from genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is green\n\nThe surface has been given a used look\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets\n\nAll pockets are equipped with a zip\n\nThe thermal inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nA connecting zip has been sewn into the jacket\n\nSo you can use any trousers as a connection\n\nThe counterpart for sewing in is included in the scope of delivery\n\n5 protector pockets on the shoulders, elbow and back\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nThere is a Velcro fastener on the sides to adjust the waist\n\nThere is a zip under the Velcro fastener for expansion\n\nEach side can be extended by up to 5 cm\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nPlease pay attention to the size chart\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1061-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1075","slug":"motorbike-retro-leather-jacket-blue-pcp-lj-1075","name":"Motorbike Retro Leather Jacket – Blue","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made from genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is blue\n\nThe surface has been given a used look\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets\n\nAll pockets are equipped with a zip\n\nThe thermal inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nA connecting zip has been sewn into the jacket\n\nSo you can use any trousers as a connection\n\nThe counterpart for sewing in is included in the scope of delivery\n\n5 protector pockets on the shoulders, elbow and back\n\nThere is a Velcro fastener on the sides to adjust the waist\n\nThere is a zip under the Velcro fastener for expansion\n\nEach side can be extended by up to 5 cm\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1075-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1051","slug":"matt-black-nubuck-motorbike-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1051","name":"Matt Black Nubuck Motorbike Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"The jacket is made from genuine buffalo nubuck leather with a thickness of approx. 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather is thick, but very soft and comfortable to wear\n\nBoth shoulders are quilted\n\nThey have a fastener on both sides for adjustment so that the jacket does not flap while riding\n\nThey have 2 inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nIn addition, they have 4 outside pockets, all 4 can be closed with a zip\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nAt the collar they have a buckle for adjustment\n\nA piece of leather is used under the zip so that the jacket is windproof\n\nTailored men's cut (slim fit)\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nProtectors on shoulders, elbows and back","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1051-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1088","slug":"motorcycle-pilot-jacket-with-protectors-leather-bomber-jacket-pcp-lj-1088","name":"Motorcycle Pilot Jacket with Protectors – Leather Bomber Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Men’s pilot / bomber leather jacket\n\nMade of genuine cow nappa leather\n\nLeather thickness: 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nBase color: brown\n\nDetachable real sheepskin collar\n\nSheepskin color: beige\n\nSoft and comfortable against the skin\n\nRemovable thermal inner lining with zipper\n\nLining made of polyester\n\nUnder the thermal lining is a breathable mesh\n\nOutside: Two slit pockets / two zip pockets\n\nInside: One zip pocket / one snap pocket\n\nSmall zip pocket on the left sleeve\n\nSuitable for everyday use and for motorcycling\n\nZipper inside to connect the jacket to pants – usable as a combo suit\n\nLeather strip over the main zipper keeps the jacket windproof\n\nStraps at cuffs and waistband for the classic bomber look\"","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1088-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1084","slug":"men-s-retro-motorbike-leather-jacket-cream-white-pcp-lj-1084","name":"Men's Retro Motorbike Leather Jacket – Cream White","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The style of the old days and the technology of today offers an ultra-smart look with a straight, body-hugging cut and the quilted shoulders with typical arm rings are beautifully accentuated.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning in a stylish way\n\nBasic colour: White / cream white\n\nMaterial: Genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nLeather stability: 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-centre front zip\n\nFour front pockets with zip\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one of which has a zip\n\nZip fastening on the cuffs\n\nAll outside zips are YKK robust metal zips\n\nInner lining:- Polyester, removable black quilted lining\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super strong materials and prepared protector pockets with protectors on the back, elbows and shoulders\n\nJacket is made from genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide leather\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1084-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1076","slug":"motorbike-leather-jacket-with-motif-and-protectors-pcp-lj-1076","name":"Motorbike Leather Jacket with Motif and Protectors","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The outside of the jacket is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nWith a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nPerforated cowhide leather on the arms and back (for ventilation)\n\nThe removable inner lining consists of a polyester / cotton mix\n\nThe inner lining in the jacket is made of an air-permeable polyester\n\n3 buckles on each side to adjust the width of the waist\n\n3 outer zip pockets\n\n1 small press stud outside pocket\n\n2 inside pockets (one is equipped with a zip)\n\nConnecting zip for the trousers\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1076-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-168","slug":"men-s-motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-168","name":"Men's Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe jacket is dark brown and finished with brown accents\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides with a hook-and-loop fastener so it doesn't flap while riding\n\nTwo arm pockets\n\nOff-centered front zipper\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be maintained with everyday care products such as care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nTwo front zippered pockets\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-168-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-169","slug":"men-s-motorcycle-leather-jacket-with-a-used-look-pcp-lj-169","name":"Men's Motorcycle Leather Jacket with a Used Look","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"Jacket made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe jacket is dark brown and finished with brown accents\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nOff-center front zipper\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be maintained with everyday care products such as care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nTwo front zippered pockets","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-169-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-125","slug":"motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-125","name":"Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"Jacket made of genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide\n\nExcellent quality and workmanship\n\nComfortable to wear\n\nWith this jacket , fashionistas create the trendy biker look.\n\nTimeless model offers an ultra-stylish look\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way\n\nBase color: Black\n\nMaterial: 100% COWHIDE\n\nLeather strength: 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nSlanted zippers\n\nThe jacket can also be closed with two snap fasteners\n\nFour front pockets with zippers\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with a zipper\n\nZipper closure on the cuffs\n\nAll external zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nProtectors on the back, elbows, and shoulders\n\nProtectors are removable","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-125-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1062","slug":"motorbike-jacket-made-of-genuine-leather-black-pcp-lj-1062","name":"Motorbike Jacket Made of Genuine Leather – Black","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"The jacket is made from genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets\n\nAll pockets are equipped with a zip\n\nThe thermal inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nA connecting zip has been sewn into the jacket\n\nSo you can use any trousers as a connection\n\nThe counterpart for sewing in is included in the scope of delivery\n\n5 protector pockets on the shoulders, elbow and back\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nThere is a Velcro fastener on the sides to adjust the waist\n\nThere is a zip under the Velcro fastener for expansion\n\nEach side can be extended by up to 5 cm\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nPlease pay attention to the size chart","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1062-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9230","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-in-croco-look-made-of-cowhide-black-red-pcp-lv-9230","name":"Men’s Biker Leather Vest in Croco Look made of cowhide, Black / Red","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nLeather thickness approx. 1.1 – 1.2 mm\n\nBase color black and red\n\nUpper section with diamond stitching (checkered pattern)\n\nLight polyester padding under the stitching for better structure\n\nEntire vest with croco embossing for an exclusive look\n\n2 outer pockets with snap button\n\n2 inner pockets, one with zipper\n\nExtra-deep stitched inner pockets – ideal for more storage and for sewing patches on the front\n\nSides expandable by up to 5 cm with zippers\n\nStrong metal front zipper\n\nBack sewn in one piece – perfect for patches or club logos. No protruding seam.\n\nBack hem slightly rounded (approx. 5 cm) so the vest doesn’t stick out while riding\n\nInner lining made of durable polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9230-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9231","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-hunter-club-kutte-with-croco-embossing-black-red-pcp-lv-9231","name":"Men’s Leather Vest Hunter Club Kutte with Croco Embossing Black / Red","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nLeather thickness approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nBase color black or red\n\nUpper section with diamond stitching (checkered pattern)\n\nLight polyester padding under the stitching for better structure\n\nFront with croco embossing for an exclusive look\n\nNo outer pockets – ideal for side rocker patches\n\n4 inner pockets, one with zipper\n\nExtra-deep stitched inner pockets – ideal for more storage and so patches can be sewn on the front\n\nSides expandable by up to 5 cm with zippers\n\nStrong metal front zipper\n\nBack sewn in one piece – perfect for patches or club logos. No protruding seam.\n\nBack hem slightly rounded (approx. 5 cm) so the vest doesn’t stick out while riding\n\nInner lining made of durable polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9231-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9228","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-biker-cut-motorcycle-waistcoat-camouflage-black-grey-perforated-pcp-lv-9228","name":"Men’s Leather Vest Biker Cut Motorcycle Waistcoat Camouflage Black Grey Perforated","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather – premium quality, durable and long-lasting\n\nLeather thickness: approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nBase color: black-grey camouflage look\n\nPerforated leather – ensures breathability and comfort, even in summer\n\nStrong metal front zipper for secure closure\n\n4 inside pockets – one with zipper, all extra deep for storage and front patch application\n\nExpandable sides with zippers (up to 5 cm each) – adjustable fit\n\nBack without center seam – perfect for patches and club logos\n\nRounded back hem (approx. 5 cm) – prevents vest from lifting while riding\n\nLining: durable polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9228-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9229","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-hunter-club-kutte-with-croco-embossing-pcp-lv-9229","name":"Men’s Leather Vest Hunter Club Kutte with Croco Embossing","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nLeather thickness approx. 1.1–1.2 mm\n\nBase colour black\n\nUpper section with diamond quilting (check pattern)\n\nLight polyester padding under quilting for better structure\n\nFront with croco embossing for exclusive look\n\nWithout outer pockets, ideal for side rockers\n\n4 inner pockets, one with zipper\n\nInner pockets sewn extra deep – ideal for more storage and to allow patches on the front\n\nSide zippers expandable by 5 cm each side\n\nStrong metal front zipper\n\nBack smooth without centre seam – perfect for patches or club logos\n\nBack hem slightly rounded (approx. 5 cm) so vest does not stick out when riding\n\nLining made of durable polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9229-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9224","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-expandable-sides-black-closures-pcp-lv-9224","name":"Men’s Leather Vest with Expandable Sides, Black Closures","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Closure: 3 sturdy buckles (carabiner style) at the front\n\nExpandable: Side zippers allow up to 5 cm expansion on each side\n\nPockets: 2 outer pockets and 2 inner pockets (one with zipper)\n\nLining: Durable polyester\n\nBack: No annoying center seam – perfect for patches and embroidery","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9224-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-913","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-orange-cords-pcp-lv-913","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Orange Cords","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, sturdy cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features orange leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nYou can adjust the vest up to 5 cm on each side, allowing you to easily pull it over your jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-913-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-915","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-blue-trim-pcp-lv-915","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Blue Trim","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and has been finished with yellow trim\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nYou can adjust the vest up to 5 cm on each side, allowing you to easily pull it over your jacket\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-915-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-942","slug":"men-s-used-look-leather-vest-pcp-lv-942","name":"Men's Used Look Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black/antique gray with a black leather cord.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is also made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is adjustable on both sides, so you can also wear it over your jacket.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-942-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-914","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-yellow-trim-pcp-lv-914","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Yellow Trim","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and has been finished with yellow trim\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nYou can adjust the vest up to 5 cm on each side, allowing you to easily pull it over your jacket\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for fastening\n\nTwo outside pockets, two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-914-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9164","slug":"dark-blue-men-s-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9164","name":"Dark Blue Men's Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is dark blue\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\n3 chrome buckles close the vest\n\nLaced at the sides\n\nExtends up to 5 cm on each side\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cord\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nNo center back seam\n\nIdeal for patches","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9164-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-956","slug":"nubuck-brown-men-s-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-956","name":"Nubuck Brown Men's Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe leather is very soft and comfortable to wear.\n\nThe vest is brown and features brown leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nThe vest fastens with three chrome-plated buckles.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-956-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9045","slug":"blue-men-s-motorcycle-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9045","name":"Blue Men's Motorcycle Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Motorcycle leather vest made of genuine cowhide\n\nwith a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather has been dyed blue for a unique look\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on the sides thanks to the lacing\n\nSo you can also wear the vest over your jacket\n\nGenuine cowhide\n\nInner material: Lining: Polyester\n\nLeather vest / cowl / biker vest / motorcycle vest\n\nCare instructions: You can care for the leather with leather balm\n\n3 chrome-plated buckles as closures\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper\n\nThe cowl has no center back seam\n\nIdeal for patches / club logos\n\nThe biker vest has been finished with leather cords in the same color.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9045-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9040","slug":"brown-men-s-leather-vest-with-expandable-sides-pcp-lv-9040","name":"Brown Men's Leather Vest with Expandable Sides","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"3 chrome-plated buckles (snap hooks) for closure\n\nGenuine cowhide\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nRough leather is very comfortable to wear (thick yet soft leather)\n\nThe vest can be expanded by 5 cm on the sides thanks to the zipper (each side)\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThe vest is ideal for patches\n\nNo annoying center back seam","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9040-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9024","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-laser-engraving-on-the-back-pcp-lv-9024","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Laser Engraving on the Back","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Three metal fasteners, buckle closure\n\nlaced on both sides (extendable up to 8 cm)\n\nwraparound cord (elaborately braided by hand)\n\ntwo outside pockets\n\ntwo deep inside pockets, one with a zipper\n\nno center back seam\n\neye-catching laser print\n\nvery simple and easy to care for\n\n100% COWHIDE LEATHER (1.1 mm to 1.2 mm)\n\ndark brown with brown leather cords\n\nPlease refer to the size chart included in the images","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9024-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9016","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-red-white-cords-pcp-lv-9016","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Red/White Cords","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features red/white leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, allowing you to wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9016-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9015","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-red-black-cords-pcp-lv-9015","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Red/Black Cords","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features red/black leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, allowing you to wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9015-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9137","slug":"men-s-vintage-leather-vest-jeans-style-pcp-lv-9137","name":"Men's Vintage Leather Vest Jeans Style","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and has been treated with a distressed look\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nFour outer pockets, the chest pockets close with snap fasteners\n\nThe vest closes on both sides\n\nIt has a zipper closure\n\nTwo deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nWindproof thanks to a piece of leather that covers the closure","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9137-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9007","slug":"biker-leather-vest-without-pockets-ideal-for-side-rockers-pcp-lv-9007","name":"Biker leather vest without pockets, ideal for side rockers","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nLeather thickness: 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nBlack base color.\n\nClosed on both sides.\n\nNo outer pockets.\n\nTwo inner pockets, one with a zipper.\n\nNo center back seam, ideal for patches.\n\nInner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9007-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-995","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-995","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe vest fastens with buckles.\n\nTwo outside pockets, two inside pockets.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nClosed at the sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-995-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9169","slug":"black-leather-vest-without-fasteners-pcp-lv-9169","name":"Black Leather Vest without Fasteners","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is braided with a leather cord.\n\nFor a unique look.\n\nIdeal for custom fastenings.\n\nThe vest has no fasteners.\n\n2 outside pockets.\n\n2 inside pockets.\n\nExpandable by lacing up to 5 cm on each side.\n\nSo you can also wear the vest over a jacket.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9169-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9163","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-eagle-embosser-pcp-lv-9163","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Eagle Embosser","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\n1.1 to 1.2 mm thick\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nAn eagle embossed into the leather on the back\n\n10 adjustable buckles\n\n3 buckles for closure\n\nThe vest is lined with leather cords on the sides\n\n2 outer pockets with zippers\n\n2 inner pockets (one with zipper)\n\nThe vest is woven with leather cords\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9163-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9161","slug":"vintage-leather-vest-with-eagle-embosser-buckles-pcp-lv-9161","name":"Vintage Leather Vest with Eagle Embosser Buckles","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe leather has been treated for a vintage look\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\n2 outer pockets\n\n2 inner pockets\n\nOne inner pocket has a zipper closure\n\nThe other inner pocket has a snap fastener\n\nThe back panel has an eagle embossing\n\nThe embossing was punched into the leather from the inside\n\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on each side\n\nA piece of leather is sewn under the drawstring\n\nTo prevent the vest from inflating while riding\n\n3 buckles for the vest closure","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9161-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9162","slug":"camouflage-men-s-leather-vest-with-buckles-pcp-lv-9162","name":"Camouflage Men's Leather Vest with Buckles","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe surface is dyed in a camouflage pattern.\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper).\n\n2 outside pockets.\n\nSides are expandable with zippers.\n\nExpandable by up to 5 cm per side.\n\nNo center back seam.\n\nIdeal for patches.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9162-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-977","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-side-laces-pcp-lv-977","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Side Laces","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"This men's leather vest is made of genuine and durable cowhide.\n\nLaced on both sides.\n\nIdeal for patches, meaning there's no center seam on the back.\n\nThe inside pockets are slightly deeper, allowing the front of the chest to accommodate patches without sewing the inside pocket.\n\nThe lining is made of polyester.\n\nThree chrome buckles close the vest.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides.\n\nPlease refer to the size chart in the images.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-977-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9156","slug":"men-s-snap-button-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9156","name":"Men's Snap-Button Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\n2 exterior pockets\n\n2 interior pockets\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\n4 snap fasteners\n\nExtends by 5 cm on both sides","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9156-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9155","slug":"buckle-biker-leather-vest-made-of-buffalo-nubuck-leather-pcp-lv-9155","name":"Buckle Biker Leather Vest Made of Buffalo Nubuck Leather","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine Buffalo Nubuck Leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nLaced on both sides (extendable up to 5 cm per side)\n\nThe vest is braided with leather cords\n\nAdjustable with 3 buckles on the sides\n\n3 brass snap hooks for closure\n\n2 outer pockets with zippers\n\n2 inner pockets\n\nNo center back seam","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9155-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9149","slug":"motorcycle-leather-vest-biker-in-red-snake-pattern-pcp-lv-9149","name":"Motorcycle Leather Vest Biker in Red Snake Pattern","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe surface has been dyed\n\nFor a unique look\n\nNo annoying seam at the front\n\nNo front pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nThe inside pockets are sewn slightly deeper\n\nTo accommodate the patches at the front\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side\n\nThere is also no annoying seam at the back\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9149-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9146","slug":"buffalo-nubuck-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9146","name":"Buffalo Nubuck Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine nubuck buffalo leather\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nComfortable to wear\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on each side\n\nSo you can also wear the vest over a jacket\n\n