owhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-949-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9143","slug":"gray-vintage-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9143","name":"Gray Vintage Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"3 chrome-plated buckles for closure\n\nLaced at the sides\n\nExtends by 5 cm on each side\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets (one with zipper)\n\nUnique vintage coloring\n\nThe vest is braided with a gray leather band around the waist\n\nNo annoying seam on the back\n\nIdeal for patches\n\nThe vest is made of genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is gray\n\nThe leather has been treated with a vintage effect\n\nFor a unique retro look","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9143-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-947","slug":"motorcycle-leather-vest-with-zippered-pockets-pcp-lv-947","name":"Motorcycle Leather Vest with Zippered Pockets","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets wi