 interior pockets\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThere are zippers on the sides\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on each side\n\nThere is no annoying seam on the back\n\nIdeal for patches","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9121-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9197","slug":"men-s-vintage-leather-vest-with-expandable-zipper-pcp-lv-9197","name":"Men's Vintage Leather Vest with Expandable Zipper","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"3 buckles (carabiner) closure, brass-look\n\nGenuine cowhide\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color is brown\n\nThe surface has been dyed black (vintage/used look)\n\nThe vest can be expanded by 5 cm on the sides thanks to the zipper (each side)\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThe vest is ideal for patches\n\nNo annoying center back seam","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9197-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-945","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-pockets-pcp-lv-945","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Pockets","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features black leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles as closures.\n\nThree outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is also made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-945-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9196","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-extensions-pcp-lv-9196","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Extensions","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe leather is hand-braided on the shoulders and back for a unique look.\n\nWith a stand-up collar.\n\nLeather windbreaker with snap fastener.\n\nZipper as the vest's main closure.\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on the sides thanks to the zipper (each side).\n\n4 exterior pockets, including 2 chest pockets. All exterior pockets have snap fasteners.\n\n2 interior pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe lining is made of sturdy polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9196-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9120","slug":"buckle-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9120","name":"Buckle Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather is thick yet soft\n\nThe base color is black\n\nThree exterior pockets\n\nTwo interior pockets\n\nOne interior pocket has a zipper\n\nAll exterior pockets can be closed with belt loops\n\nThere are three adjustable buckles on each shoulder\n\nThere are also three adjustable buckles on the sides\n\nThere are lacings under the straps to adjust the width\n\nAll straps/buckles are firmly riveted and therefore very durable\n\nThere are no annoying seams on the back\n\nIdeal for patches and club logos","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9120-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9127","slug":"matte-black-buffalo-nubuck-leather-motorcycle-biker-vest-pcp-lv-9127","name":"Matte Black Buffalo Nubuck Leather Motorcycle Biker Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine buffalo nubuck leather.\n\nWith a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nThe base color of the leather is black.\n\n2 outer pockets with zippers.\n\n2 inner pockets, one with zipper.\n\nA piece of leather is sewn under the main zipper.\n\nTo make the vest windproof.\n\nThe inner lining is made of a cotton blend.\n\nThe vest is adjustable on the sides with hook-and-loop fasteners.\n\nIdeal for patches.","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9127-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9194","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-in-brown-pcp-lv-9194","name":"Men's Leather Vest in Brown","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the 