924","name":"Biker Leather Vest in Gray","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is gray and features gray leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended by up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-924-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-941","slug":"brown-men-s-cowhide-biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-941","name":"Brown Men's Cowhide Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather has a brown base color\n\nVintage brown (nice retro style)\n\nSide zips\n\nThe vest can be extended by 5 cm on each side\n\nNo center back seam\n\nIdeal for patches/club logos\n\n2 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper\n\nThe vest has a leather trim made of brown braided cords","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-941-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV