d\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles as a closure\n\n2 large outer pockets\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-909-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-908","slug":"biker-leather-vest-with-pockets-and-buckle-closure-pcp-lv-908","name":"Biker Leather Vest with Pockets and Buckle Closure","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, sturdy cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe vest is black and finished with black leather cord\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe vest is expandable up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles as a closure\n\n2 large outer pockets\n\nOne chest pocket\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nTailored women's cut (so the vest doesn't stick out)\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-908-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9170","slug":"antique-leather-vest-biker-jacket-made-of-genuine-leather-pcp-lv-9170","name":"Antique Leather Vest Biker Jacket Made of Genuine Leather","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Men's Vintage Leather Vest / Jacket\n\nThe leather is made of genuine nappa cowhide\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nVery comfortable to wear\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown\n\nThe surface was dyed black and then lightly scraped while drying\n\nFor a unique used look\n\nThe leather thickness is 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather jacket has been finished with a leather strap around the edges\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides\n\nIdeal for patches\n\n2 outer pockets with snap fasteners\n\n2 inner pockets, one with a zipper\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\n3 chrome-plated buckles/carabiners as closures\n\nAll closures are firmly riveted through the leather","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9170-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-906","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-blue-cords-pcp-lv-906","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Blue Cords","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and has been finished with blue leather cord.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-906-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-905","slug":"men-s-biker-leather-vest-with-yellow-trim-pcp-lv-905","name":"Men's Biker Leather Vest with Yellow Trim","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and finished with yellow leather cord.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-905-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9108","slug":"brown-men-s-leather-vest-pcp-lv-9108","name":"Brown Men's Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown\n\nThe vest is woven with leather cords all around\n\nTwo regular slit outer pockets\n\nTwo breast pockets with snap fasteners\n\nTwo zippered inner pockets\n\nTwo large inner pockets\n\nTwo small inner pockets\n\nThree brass snap hooks for closure\n\nA total of 16 buckles\n\n5 buckles on each side\n\n3 buckles on each shoulder\n\nAll buckles and buttons are brass colored (matching the vest)\n\nLeather lacing is incorporated under the buckles\n\nA leather piece is sewn