"S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-929-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-926","slug":"biker-leather-vest-pcp-lv-926","name":"Biker Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and has a leather border.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe inner lining is also made of 100% genuine cowhide.\n\nThey have a zipper closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets and two deep inner pockets, both with zippers.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-926-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9025","slug":"biker-leather-vest-with-side-zippers-pcp-lv-9025","name":"Biker Leather Vest with Side Zippers","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and finished with leather cord.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc.\n\nThe leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest can be extended up to 5 cm on both sides, so you can also wear it over a jacket.\n\nIt has three chrome-plated buckles for closure.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which has a zipper.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9025-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-951","slug":"men-s-genuine-cowhide-leather-vest-pcp-lv-951","name":"Men's Genuine Cowhide Leather Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine, robust cowhide leather, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches (no center back seam).\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be treated with everyday care products such as leather care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nThe vest closes with four strong snap fasteners.\n\nTwo outer pockets, two deep inner pockets, one of which is equipped with a zipper.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nThe vest is closed on both sides.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-951-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9210","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-hunter-motorcycle-club-vest-pcp-lv-9210","name":"Men's Leather Vest Hunter Motorcycle Club Vest","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Genuine cowhide and buffalo nubuck leather\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe base color of the leather is black\n\nThe upper part is quilted with a check pattern and is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nA polyester filling is sewn under the quilting to make the pattern more visible.\n\nThe lower part is made of perforated buffalo nubuck leather in matte black.\n\n2 outer pockets with hidden snap closures.\n\n2 inner pockets (one with a zipper).\n\nThe inner pockets are sewn slightly deeper.\n\nTo accommodate the patches on the front.\n\nExpandable on the sides with zippers.\n\nExpandable by 5 cm on each side.\n\nThe back end is rounded by 5 cm.\n\nTo prevent the vest from sticking out while riding.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9210-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-9005","slug":"snap-button-leather-vest-in-black-pcp-lv-9005","name":"Snap-Button Leather Vest in Black","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"The vest is made of genuine cowhide.\n\nLeather thickness: 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nBlack base color.\n\nLaced on both sides.\n\nSnap-button closure.\n\nTwo exterior pockets.\n\nTwo interior pockets, one with a zipper.\n\nNo center back seam, ideal for patches.\n\nInner lining is made of polyester.","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LV-9005-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LV-919","slug":"men-s-leather-vest-with-patch-pockets-pcp-lv-919","name":"Men's Leather Vest with Patch Pockets","category":"Men's Vest","categorySlug":"men-s-vest","description":"Vest made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe vest is black and features black leather cords.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it 